# The application does not read environment variables for API keys.
# For the optional screenshot import, paste your key into the masked field in the interface.
# It is held in memory for the session only. Never put real keys in files that get committed.
#
# Operator settings (set in the environment that starts the app):
#   PORTFOLIO_RISK_DISABLE_IMPORT=1                  switch the screenshot import off
#   PORTFOLIO_RISK_DISABLE_DOWNLOAD=1                switch the price download off
#   PORTFOLIO_RISK_VISION_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000   testing only; localhost addresses only
